ost` prerequisite of `make verify`), a ci_gate mechanism whose mechanism-ok marker names this ticket as its sunset. It exists because agent sandboxes deny AF_UNIX sockets and outbound HTTPS that the suite needs.\n\n## Approach\nRemove the script, its test, the Makefile target and the docs section once either (a) the suite no longer needs those capabilities (the reclaim re-sign tests no longer use a socket ssh-agent, build-provenance tests build without isolation from the index, and the opengrep backend validates offline), or (b) every supported local agent harness grants them to `make verify`.\n\n## Scope\n- `scripts/check_verify_host.py`, `tests/unit/test_check_verify_host.py`, `Makefile`, `docs/local-dev-env.md`, `AGENTS.md`\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The preflight and its docs are removed, with the condition (a) or (b) that made it unnecessary recorded here.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":4,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1fde-830c-067b-4976","ticket_type":"task","title":"Retire the make verify host preflight when no supported local host can lack AF_UNIX sockets or outbound HTTPS","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6fbe2dae-ae4d-4ef3-a1fe-61c6e47da2f4","31b5360f-c9c7-4688-85e0-11785841488b"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795211481482051002,"uuid":"4e64cb73-a5a9-4f52-b939-a0922b03de2e"}